fixture landing_clamps_dash_speed
doc BUILD.md s5 Dash "Dash-jump: the fastest horizontal movement in the game"; docs/adr/0010 "the ground slows back to run speed": a landing loses speed above run speed before a buffered jump fires, so bunny-hopping does not keep a dash-jump's speed
room test/wide
spawn 100 544
frames 200
input
  0 R dash
  1..3 R
  4..8 R jump
  9..199 R !jump
end
expect
  at 4 event.jump=1 vx=5120
  # The dash-jump keeps 20 u/f through its whole airtime.
  during 5..30 vx=5120
  # The landing frame drops to run speed (9 u/f), and the buffered jump leaves at run speed.
  mark land 30..60 event.land=1
  at land vx=2304 event.jump=1
  at 150 vx=2304
end
